| T (목표 조각 어절) | laal_words ↓ | **effective** ↑ | eff p10 ↑ | eff min ↑ | eff (ent) | adequacy | contradiction ↓ | contra (ent) | consistency | k | 부족 경계 |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 4 | 3.39 | **0.5978** | 0.4534 | 0.2684 | 0.5479 | 0.6942 | 0.1216 | — | 0.5925 | 5.26 | 0.00 |
| 6 | 5.11 | **0.6685** | 0.5057 | 0.2588 | 0.6174 | 0.7655 | 0.0815 | — | 0.7355 | 3.52 | 0.00 |
